Primary source: SPHMC 2609.06906v1, S4.E6 and S4.SS1.p4.3 (local raw lines1296–1314). Its first inequality combines standard-Gaussian Talagrand and Gaussian LSI. The source leaves the cutoff/domain justification implicit. Its standardized density is proportional to exp(-‖u‖²/2-rho(u)); rho has zero gradient at0 and Hessian between0 and eta. This packet addresses only Gaussian LSI background, leaving T2 and FIRST4.6 separate.

